//   tmp  = alpha * A * B
//   D    = alpha * A * B * C + beta * D
// with shapes:
//   A:   i x k
//   B:   k x j
//   tmp: i x j
//   C:   j x l
//   D:   i x l
//
// Optimized for data locality:
//  - First phase uses loop order i-k-j, so:
//      * A[i,k]   is reused across a whole row of B[k,*] and tmp[i,*]
//      * B[k,*]   and tmp[i,*] are traversed contiguously in 'j'
